      "writtenOn": "2021-10-07T18:51:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since VecMethods defines load and store, could they also define this operator[]?\n\nIf so, then Vec\u003c4\u003e and Vec\u003c2\u003e wouldn\u0027t need to overload it and their x/y/z/w() functions could just be implemented as this[0], this[1], etc. instead of walking a path through the hi\u0027s/lo\u0027s.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 113,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 114,
        "endChar": 89
      },
      "revId": "81dd9a5a9c23a5971eab1fe095afb7fba28960b0",
